flowchart TB
    subgraph Fast[快速、隔离、易定位]
        direction LR
        Rules[业务规则与状态转换]
        Common[commonTest：Fake + TestDispatcher]
        Platform[平台适配测试：SDK / callback / driver]
        Rules --> Common
        Common --> Platform
    end

    subgraph Real[更真实、接近发布]
        direction LR
        Integration[Android / iOS 集成测试]
        Smoke[AAR / Framework / XCFramework 冒烟测试]
        CI[CI 构建、安装与关键路径验证]
        Integration --> Smoke
        Smoke --> CI
    end

    Platform --> Integration
